AT (0.0, 0.0, 2.8) RELATIVE aperture1

COMPONENT APERTURE2 = Slit(
 radius = A2)
AT (0.0, 0.0, L1) RELATIVE aperture1

COMPONENT lmon2 = L_monitor(
